    {
      "path": "MEMORY.md",
      "content": "# Curated memory\n\n## Travel\n\n- For overnight flights, Mira prefers an aisle seat away from the lavatory.\n- During Berlin visits, Mira stays at the Lindenhof Hotel near the east station.\n- The luggage service booking reference is 48392017.\n## Project Atlas\n\n- The Atlas migration owner is Devon Chen; questions about the cutover go to Devon. <!-- project: github.com/example/atlas --> <!-- importance: 7 -->\n- Atlas production cutover is scheduled for 2026-11-08 at 02:00 UTC. <!-- project: github.com/example/atlas --> <!-- importance: 7 -->\n- Atlas staging listens on TCP port 7419. <!-- project: github.com/example/atlas --> <!-- importance: 7 -->\n## Finance\n\n- Invoices from Northstar Hosting map to account 6210 for the synthetic Acorn account.\n- Blue Finch Studio invoices are due forty-five days after their issue date.\n- The bookkeeping export code for Blue Finch Studio is BF-029184.\n## Accessibility\n\n- Sam needs captions enabled for every remote meeting because speech alone is difficult to follow.\n- Sam prefers reduced motion and no autoplaying animations in the dashboard.\n- Use the high-contrast interface theme for Sam during screen sharing.\n## Incident response\n\n- For a stalled Oriole import, pause its scheduler before retrying the failed batch once.\n- If the Oriole import fails twice, escalate to the data platform on-call instead of retrying again.\n- The synthetic Oriole outage incident number is 90715264.\n## Food preferences\n\n- Priya is vegan and does not eat honey.\n- Priya drinks decaffeinated coffee after noon.\n- Priya is allergic to cashews.\n## Release process\n\n- The Juniper release checklist requires a canary deployment followed by a fifteen-minute error-rate check.\n- Taylor is responsible for approving Juniper production releases.\n- The synthetic Juniper rollback reference is release-2037-amber.\n## Support routing\n\n- A customer unable to export their records gets priority two unless data is being lost.\n- The North team covers support from 07:00 to 15:00 UTC on weekdays.\n- Support queue ticket 58273016 belongs to the North team.\n## Short facts\n\n- TZ: UTC.\n- Locale: de-AT.\n- Size: XS.\n## Cedar deadline: 2026-10-19\n- Cedar is coordinated by Ada.\n## Birch status: CANCELLED\n- Do not schedule further Birch work.\n## Warehouse pickup code: 61820473\n- Show the code at reception.\n### Project: github.com/example/beta\n\n<!-- openclaw-memory-promotion:memory:beta -->\n- Beta deployment uses region eu-north-1. <!-- project: github.com/example/beta --> <!-- trigger: Beta deployment --> <!-- importance: 9 -->\n- Alpha deployment uses region us-west-2. <!-- project: github.com/example/alpha --> <!-- trigger: Alpha deployment --> <!-- importance: 4 -->\n",
      "curatedRoot": true,
      "originClass": "owner"
    },
    {
